#
# --- Upstream Dockerfile copies inside the image (mech-server) ------------
# Three copies of the upstream agent_server Dockerfile ship inside the
# image (installed package, build/lib, source checkout); their
# `apt-get install` calls lack --no-install-recommends. Upstream-controlled
# files — the flag belongs in the OpenHands SDK, not this repo.
DS-0029 exp:2027-01-03
#
# --- CIS baseline: build/CI tool images ---------------------------------
# DS-0002 (runs as root) and DS-0026 (no HEALTHCHECK): these images are CI
# build/tool containers, not deployed services. Non-root would change
# ownership of mounted workspace artifacts for no exploitable gain, and a
# HEALTHCHECK is meaningless for batch tooling (the publish and audit
# gates are the health checks). For mech-server both findings are
# upstream-owned (the image is assembled by the OpenHands agent-server
# build, not a Dockerfile in this repository). See docs/operations.md
# "Container hardening -> CIS baseline".
AVD-DS-0002 exp:2027-01-04
AVD-DS-0026 exp:2027-01-04
